texts = Array[String](["Write your username and submit it by pressing ENTER. You can change it later by pressing ESCAPE.", "Sense restless tombstones by pressing ARROW KEYS. The color of the indicator changes and gets closer to you the closer they are.", "Move around using WASD. You move slower when sensing for tombs.", "Press F to pay respects. Paying respects soothes nearby tombstones.", "Press SPACE to jump. You can move over some obstacles that way.", "Press SPACE when you are about to land to not fall down. Sensing tombs makes the timing stricter. Touching a wall while airborne knocks you down.", "Press ENTER to start. You can sense for tombs during the countdown. Try to be faster than the spirits of respecters past."])
